     the AP2112K's 125 C current 0.3056 A; S3' largest 0.4240 A; TPS2553-1 at 49.9 kOhm IOS 0.4702 to 0.5704 A; theta at most 98.6 C/W; T10-A3 3.6082 V
     against 3.7486 V on the AP2112's rows: EQUAL to W135's printed figures
     W159 on W157-F2: the band this record uses is the envelope of that rule and TI's Equation 1 at the 1 % resistor's bounds (SLVS841F
     10.2.1.2.3 and Table 2): IOS 0.4702 to 0.5878 A, so the theta that holds 125 C at IOSmax is 95.7 C/W (every figure below is on it)

