     TPS73733DCQRM3 (SOT-223, new silicon)         76.0     115.0    0.1470     3.4965    +0.1072  QUALIFIES
     TPS73733DCQR (no M3: legacy may ship)         76.0     115.0    0.2939     3.6929    -0.0893  FAILS
